      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s01_c01",
      "text": "VideoComposer, from Alibaba and Ant Group, makes video generation controllable through composition.",
      "box": [
        0.0531,
        0.1847,
        0.592,
        0.3056
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 1,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_users_combine_textual_spatial_tempor",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
      "text": "Users combine textual, spatial, and temporal conditions at once.",
      "box": [
        0.0558,
        0.5378,
        0.4848,
        0.1344
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 1,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_its_key_ideas_motion_vectors",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
      "text": "Its key ideas: motion vectors from compressed video as an explicit temporal signal, and a unified Spatio-Temporal Condition encoder that fuses diverse controls while keeping frames consistent, from text and sketches to reference video or simple strokes.",
      "box": [
        0.0563,
        0.7028,
        0.4988,
        0.1367
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 2,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c1_diffusion_models_made_image_generati",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s02_c01",
      "text": "Diffusion models made image generation highly controllable, but video is much harder.",
      "box": [
        0.0563,
        0.2667,
        0.2812,
        0.5
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 2,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c2_video_adds_temporal_axis_motion",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunk_id": "s02_c02",
      "text": "Video adds a temporal axis: motion patterns vary enormously across clips, and every frame must stay consistent with its neighbours.",
      "box": [
        0.3594,
        0.2667,
        0.2812,
        0.5
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 2,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c3_reusing_spatial_controls_designed_im",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "chunk_id": "s02_c03",
      "text": "Reusing the spatial controls designed for images gives no reliable handle on temporal dynamics, so controllable video synthesis stayed an open challenge.",
      "box": [
        0.6625,
        0.2667,
        0.2812,
        0.5
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 3,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c1_control_video_you_must_control",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s03_c01",
      "text": "To control a video, you must control its motion, not only its appearance.",
      "box": [
        0.0563,
        0.2222,
        0.5375,
        0.1194
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 3,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c2_authors_insight_motion_vectors_compu",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunk_id": "s03_c02",
      "text": "The authors' insight: motion vectors, computed inside compressed video to encode inter-frame change, are a cheap, explicit description of temporal dynamics.",
      "box": [
        0.0563,
        0.3694,
        0.2594,
        0.2329
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 3,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c3_turning_them_control_signal_lets",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "chunk_id": "s03_c03",
      "text": "Turning them into a control signal lets users prescribe how things move.",
      "box": [
        0.3281,
        0.3694,
        0.2656,
        0.2329
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 3,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c4_but_mixing_them_sketches_depth",
      "chunk_index": 4,
      "chunk_id": "s03_c04",
      "text": "But mixing them with sketches, depth, and images naively hurts consistency, motivating a unified encoder for space and time.",
      "box": [
        0.0563,
        0.6278,
        0.5375,
        0.1389
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 4,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c1_videocomposer_makes_three_contributi",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s04_c01",
      "text": "VideoComposer makes three contributions.",
      "box": [
        0.0563,
        0.2194,
        0.8875,
        0.1
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 4,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_first_frames_video_generation_compos",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunk_id": "s04_c02",
      "text": "First, it frames video generation as compositional: a user supplies any subset of textual, spatial, and temporal conditions, and the model recomposes a video obeying all of them.",
      "box": [
        0.0563,
        0.3472,
        0.2812,
        0.4056
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 4,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_second_introduces_motion_vectors_com",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
      "text": "Second, it introduces motion vectors from compressed video as an explicit temporal control signal.",
      "box": [
        0.3594,
        0.3472,
        0.2812,
        0.4056
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 4,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_third_proposes_spatio_temporal_condi",
      "chunk_index": 4,
      "chunk_id": "s04_c04",
      "text": "Third, it proposes the Spatio-Temporal Condition encoder, a lightweight module that turns every sequential condition into a shared representation while boosting temporal consistency.",
      "box": [
        0.6625,
        0.3472,
        0.2812,
        0.4056
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 5,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c1_videocomposer_latent_diffusion_denoi",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s05_c01",
      "text": "VideoComposer is a latent diffusion model that denoises video in a compressed latent space. Each training video is decomposed into three families of conditions, textual, spatial, and temporal, combined freely.",
      "box": [
        0.5594,
        0.2194,
        0.3844,
        0.1333
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 5,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c2_sequential_conditions_like_motion_ve",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunk_id": "s05_c02",
      "text": "Sequential conditions like motion vectors, depth maps, masks, and sketches all pass through one shared STC-encoder: two convolutions and pooling capture local spatial structure, then a temporal Transformer models change across frames.",
      "box": [
        0.5594,
        0.3694,
        0.3844,
        0.1959
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 5,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c3_encoded_conditions_summed_concatenat",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "chunk_id": "s05_c03",
      "text": "Encoded conditions are summed and concatenated with the noisy latent, while text and style enter through cross-attention.",
      "box": [
        0.5594,
        0.5806,
        0.4406,
        0.1028
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 5,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c4_runs_two_stages_inference_ddim",
      "chunk_index": 4,
      "chunk_id": "s05_c04",
      "text": "Training runs in two stages, and inference uses DDIM sampling with classifier-free guidance.",
      "box": [
        0.5594,
        0.7,
        0.3844,
        0.0917
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 6,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s06_c1_videocomposer_trained_two_public_dat",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s06_c01",
      "text": "VideoComposer is trained on two public datasets: WebVid-10M, about ten million video-caption pairs from the web, and LAION-400M, CLIP-filtered image-caption pairs for visual quality.",
      "box": [
        0.0563,
        0.2389,
        0.4281,
        0.5278
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 6,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s06_c2_evaluation_authors_report_text_to_vi",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunk_id": "s06_c02",
      "text": "For evaluation, the authors report text-to-video on MSR-VTT using Fréchet Video Distance and CLIP similarity, and measure motion controllability on a thousand caption-video pairs with a dedicated motion-control error.",
      "box": [
        0.5156,
        0.2389,
        0.4281,
        0.5278
      ],
      "target_source": "svg"
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 7,
      "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c1_msr_vtt_videocomposer_achieves_chet",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s07_c01",
      "text": "On MSR-VTT, VideoComposer achieves a Fréchet Video Distance of five hundred eighty and a CLIP similarity of zero point two nine three two, zero-shot.",
