      "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c3_adding_compositional_multi_condition",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "chunk_id": "s07_c03",
      "text": "So adding compositional, multi-condition control costs nothing in quality, while videos follow the sketches, depth, motion, and styles users provide.",
